option.shadowSsrt=Distant Shadows
option.shadowSsrt.comment=Extends shadows beyond the shadow map distance using screen-space ray tracing. Fills in far shadows without increasing shadow map size. Moderate performance cost.
option.shadowSsrtSteps=Distant Shadow Quality
option.shadowSsrtSteps.comment=Adjusts the number of ray steps for screen-space distant shadows. Higher = more accurate, less noisy far shadows at higher GPU cost.
option.vanillaAoLift=Vanilla AO Lift
option.vanillaAoLift.comment=Lifts the darkest vanilla AO shadows toward flat lighting. Higher = shallower, more washed-out crevices; 0 = full-depth vanilla AO.
option.ssaoRadius.comment=Adjusts the radius of SSAO -  the distance from which objects can occlude each other
option.ssaoSteps.comment=Number of samples used by the screen-space ambient occlusion. More samples give a smoother result but cost more performance.
option.gtaoRadius.comment=Adjusts the radius of GTAO - the distance from which objects can occlude each other
option.gtaoHorizonSteps.comment=Controls the accuracy of GTAO. A higher step count also increase the intensity of the effect
option.atmosphereSaturationBoost.comment=Increases the saturation of the sky and sunlight color depending on the time of day
option.atmosphereSaturationBoostIntensity.comment=How strongly the colours of the sky and haze are pushed towards saturation. Higher values give richer, more vivid skies.
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation=Atmosphere Rain Desaturation
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation.comment=Desaturates the atmosphere during rain, making for colder looking rain
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity=Desaturation Intensity
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity.comment=How much the sky and the haze lose their colour while it rains. Higher values give rainy weather a flatter, greyer look.
