suffix.blockyCloudsAltitude=m
suffix.blockyCloudsAltitude2=m
option.blockyCloudsPrimarySteps=Primary Steps
option.blockyCloudsPrimarySteps.comment=Number of ray-march samples used to find the blocky clouds along the view ray. More steps resolve the shape of the blocks but cost more GPU time.
option.blockyCloudsLightSteps=Lighting Steps
option.blockyCloudsLightSteps.comment=Number of extra samples used to march towards the sun for blocky cloud lighting. More steps give smoother light gradients across the cloud.
option.blockyCloudsDensity=Density
option.blockyCloudsDensity.comment=Adjusts the density of the clouds. Higher values increase noise
option.blockyCloudsBrightness=Brightness
option.blockyCloudsBrightness.comment=Overall brightness of the blocky clouds. Higher values make them glow more against the sky.
option.blockyCloudsBottomlight=Bottom Brightness
option.blockyCloudsBottomlight.comment=Brightness of the undersides of the blocky clouds. Higher values light the cloud bases more, as if light were bouncing up from below.
option.blockyCloudsSize=Size
option.blockyCloudsSize.comment=Size of the individual blocky cloud cells. Larger cells make the clouds look coarser and more blocky.
option.blockyCloudsAtmosphericScattering=Atmospheric Scattering
option.blockyCloudsAtmosphericScattering.comment=When enabled, tints clouds slightly red. This effect increases with distance
option.blockyCloudsWindSpeed=Wind Speed
